WEBVTT

00:00.400 --> 00:07.483
EmbodiedStudio turns a task request into a physically grounded simulation, with trajectories and replayable scoring.

00:08.050 --> 00:10.887
Putting food away takes more than a realistic kitchen.

00:11.067 --> 00:15.163
The food must move, the shelf must fit it, and the score must check event order.

00:16.050 --> 00:24.946
EmbodiedStudio writes the scene, task, behavior, and rubric together, refining them with simulator measurements and independent review before freezing.

00:25.800 --> 00:32.051
Inside the workbench, the frozen kitchen is a fully inspectable 3D scene ready for geometry checks.

00:35.050 --> 00:39.487
Here, the frozen program builds the kitchen from the floor up, leaving a clear aisle.

00:39.667 --> 00:43.017
Every feedback-driven edit also trains object placement.

00:47.050 --> 00:55.071
Fifty benchmark requests span tabletops, furnished rooms, and multi-room layouts, each initialized in an actionable starting state.

00:55.800 --> 01:03.032
EmbodiedStudio outperforms all five baselines across every metric, reaching ninety-eight point four percent readiness.

01:03.212 --> 01:06.540
Removing feedback or review drops geometry and readiness.

01:07.300 --> 01:09.327
Opening the drawer earns partial credit.

01:09.507 --> 01:12.941
The score rises when the pen enters, and hits one once closed.

01:13.121 --> 01:15.511
Leaving it open earns zero point seven.

01:17.800 --> 01:26.461
Across twenty tasks, our rubrics lead in expression quality and balanced accuracy, achieving zero false positives through strict verification.

02:34.800 --> 02:37.445
Our interactive appendix exposes every check.

02:37.625 --> 02:43.727
For request match, selecting the food confirms its pose, and the refrigerator pinpoints the destination.

02:44.550 --> 02:46.726
Task readiness checks the space for action.

02:46.906 --> 02:51.365
Hiding the lower door reveals the shelf, while the left aisle confirms a clear route.

02:52.050 --> 02:58.301
EmbodiedStudio: one frozen environment linking construction, execution, and replayable scores.
